==History==
2016
*The Minion Horde [[Cards|card]] was added with Clash Royale's game launch on 4/1/2016.
*On 29/2/2016, the [[Version History#March 2016 Update (29/2/2016)|March 2016 Update]], decreased the [[Minions]]' sight range to 5.5 tiles (from 6 tiles).
*On 3/5/2016, the [[Version History#May 2016 Update (3/5/2016)|May 2016 Update]], increased the {{Rarity|Common}} card Level cap to 13 (from 12), and fixed the “range bug” and decreased the Minions' range to 2 tiles (from 2.5 tiles), but their effective range is unchanged.
2018
*On 20/6/2018, the [[Version History#Summer 2018 Update (20/6/2018)|Summer 2018 Update]], gave the Minion Horde a new 0.15 seconds deploy stagger from each other.
2019
*On 1/7/2019, the [[Version History#July%202019%20Update%20(1/7/2019)|July 2019 Update]], decreased the Minions' range to 1.6 tiles (from 2 tiles), now classified as Melee: Long.
2020
* On 2/6/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (2/6/2020)|Balance Update]], decreased the deploy stagger for each Minion to 0.1 seconds (from 0.15 seconds).
*On 3/11/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (3/11/2020)|Balance Update]], added a card render to the Minion Horde's card info screen.
2021
*On 7/6/2021, the [[Version History#Summer%202021%20Update%20(7/6/2021)|Summer 2021 Update]], moved the [[Arenas|Arena]] to unlock the Minion Horde from P.E.K.K.A's Playhouse to Hog Mountain.
* On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions%20Update%20(27/10/2021)|Champions Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 14 (from 13).
2022
*On 7/12/2022, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (7/12/2022)|Balance Update]], increased the Minions' damage by 15%. It also increased the distance between the Minions upon deployment.
2023
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14).
2025
*On 31/3/2025, the [[Version History#2025 Quarter 1 Update (31/3/2025)|2025 Quarter 1 Update]], made it so that Minion Horde's spawn formation would be correctly mirrored depending on which side of the Arena it was placed.
*On 4/8/2025, the [[Version History/2025#Pass Royale and more (4/8/2025)|August 2025 Update]] increased the Minion's range to 2.5 tiles (from 1.6 tiles), and the Hitpoints by 16%.
*On 7/8/2025, a [[Version History#Maintenance Break (7/8/2025)|Maintenance Break]], decreased the Minion's hitpoints by 14%.

